# Hand-cube fixture for the mesh test suite.
# Unit cube centred at origin, single material RedMatte.
# 8 positions, 6 face-normals, 4 UVs, 6 quad faces.
# After tinyobjloader's fan triangulation: 12 triangles, 1 material.

mtllib cube.mtl

# Positions: 8 corners of the unit cube centred at origin.
v -0.5 -0.5 -0.5
v  0.5 -0.5 -0.5
v  0.5  0.5 -0.5
v -0.5  0.5 -0.5
v -0.5 -0.5  0.5
v  0.5 -0.5  0.5
v  0.5  0.5  0.5
v -0.5  0.5  0.5

# Texture coordinates: 4 corners (shared across faces).
vt 0.0 0.0
vt 1.0 0.0
vt 1.0 1.0
vt 0.0 1.0

# Normals: one per face direction (-Z, +Z, -X, +X, -Y, +Y).
vn  0.0  0.0 -1.0
vn  0.0  0.0  1.0
vn -1.0  0.0  0.0
vn  1.0  0.0  0.0
vn  0.0 -1.0  0.0
vn  0.0  1.0  0.0

usemtl RedMatte

# -Z face (back): vertices 1,2,3,4 — normal index 1
f 1/1/1 2/2/1 3/3/1 4/4/1
# +Z face (front): vertices 5,8,7,6 — normal index 2
f 5/1/2 8/2/2 7/3/2 6/4/2
# -X face (left): vertices 1,4,8,5 — normal index 3
f 1/1/3 4/2/3 8/3/3 5/4/3
# +X face (right): vertices 2,6,7,3 — normal index 4
f 2/1/4 6/2/4 7/3/4 3/4/4
# -Y face (bottom): vertices 1,5,6,2 — normal index 5
f 1/1/5 5/2/5 6/3/5 2/4/5
# +Y face (top): vertices 4,3,7,8 — normal index 6
f 4/1/6 3/2/6 7/3/6 8/4/6
